message: "If you use or mention Taktpause, please cite it as below."
title: "Taktpause: a calm, offline work and break timer"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Faridoddin
    family-names: Rezaei
    alias: Farid Rezaei
    affiliation: "Bremen, Germany"
version: 0.18.0-beta
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/Farid-python/taktpause"
url: "https://github.com/Farid-python/taktpause"
abstract: >-
  Taktpause is a free, open-source break reminder and focus timer for
  Windows and Ubuntu Linux. It reminds you to take breaks and to start
  again, and shows when you worked, per day and per task. It works offline
  and keeps all data on the user's computer.
keywords:
  - break reminder
  - focus timer
  - pomodoro
  - work timer
  - productivity
  - researchers
  - offline
  - privacy
